Source D — Healthcare IT News, \"FDA Finalizes AI/ML Action Plan Guidance,\" April 2023]\nExcerpt: \"FDA released updated guidance on AI/ML-based software as a medical device, clarifying the predetermined change control plan pathway. Legal experts interviewed noted that significant interpretive questions remain, particularly around post-market monitoring obligations.\"\n\n---\nProduce: (1) revised brief with inline source pointers, (2) unsupported-claims log."